      "writtenOn": "2018-02-05T19:34:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, this HAL is already identified by the binder object.\n\n.. foo \u003d IBiometricIris::getService();\nauto deviceId \u003d foo-\u003esetNotify(...);\n\nThen foo and deviceId both identify this device. What benefit is that?",
