      "writtenOn": "2018-02-06T03:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest \"groupId\", though this will almost always be 0 since Android doesn\u0027t support groups yet. I\u0027m not sure what it would mean for iris anyway.  We don\u0027t want to support multiple users enrolling into a single group.",
