      "writtenOn": "2018-02-06T03:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the maximum amount of time until the above-generated challenge expires.\n\nFor fingerprint, we allow up to 20 minutes, as recommended by the security team. It should probably be shorter for Iris since it draws a lot of power and you can only enroll irises for one face.",
