        "id": 1004017
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-06T03:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what you\u0027re asking here. The preEnroll() - postEnroll() calls are used to limit the time the challenge is valid under control of the framework, in addition to the above timeout.",
