      "writtenOn": "2018-02-06T03:19:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Suggest changing this to percentRemaining and documenting N.  For instance, \".. it can start at an arbitrary number like 100 or 1000 and decrement to 0, possibly non-uniformly if substantial progress is made. As long as the iris(es) are visible and progress is being made to completion, the number is expected to decrement so an enrollment UI can show a visible progress indicator. It will stop if the iris(es) go out of view or don\u0027t have sufficient detail - in which case ACQUIRED or ERROR messages should be sent, indicating an action the user needs to take.\"",
